   "tags": "Technical • CIVIL ENGINEERING • +2 / -0.66",
   "html": "<p>Consider the following statements:<br />\n1. Shear stresses on two mutually normal planes are equal in magnitude and direction.<br />\n2. The sum of normal stresses on mutually normal planes is equal to the sum of principal stresses.<br />\nOf the above statements, which is / are true ?</p>",
